{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":76506,\"title\":\"Gold Rush: White Water\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"Gold miners Dakota Fred and his son Dustin are back – returning to McKinley Creek Alaska, determined to make a fortune no matter the risk. But to find the big gold payout, they'll put their lives on the line by diving deep beneath the raging waters of one of Alaska's wildest creeks.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xgMyo8Re5uufo90Dxm773Tnjh1o.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/q4rKamx2oBAtWf3PdmIb49VezAL.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":7.2,\"voteCount\":44,\"year\":2018,\"genres\":[\"Reality\",\"Documentary\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Ended\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":9,\"totalEpisodes\":104,\"createdBy\":[\"Tom Lowry\"],\"networks\":[\"Discovery\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2025-07-18\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":1646695,\"name\":\"Dustin Hurt\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2ubCNsTnKmiRufVcwjuu8k4nCa0.jpg\"},{\"id\":1646694,\"name\":\"Fred Hurt\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/zz1BM0jK8Bzg5zhKeSnjILiMn5y.jpg\"},{\"id\":1218094,\"name\":\"Bray Poor\",\"character\":\"Narrator (voice)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mjUS21OqZUqOc7ob9pP9uEGWNmg.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"vD0McaDxIKw\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"gyJrkbFK3Wc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"iR19IKtmZlk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":128493,\"title\":\"Gold Rush: Winter's Fortune\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kK7W4fzovQQ5UPtDc7gbZfujDcf.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.30952380952380953,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":71322,\"title\":\"Aussie Gold Hunters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pZfb5gtb0ZuzmJH7ka0tRPfDwIY.jpg\",\"rating\":7.1,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.29666666666666663,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":60603,\"title\":\"The Curse of Oak Island\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gtkxUUmHDF31iDUOlxQqUXmiU71.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.28771929824561404,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":247950,\"title\":\"America's Backyard Gold\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uRnEhTIIpn29DeFf8PgoFGdkWxu.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2024,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2857142857142857,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":61833,\"title\":\"Expedition Unknown\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4OiM6apNckkqo04I7TO5VmQl65R.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.27318840579710146,\"_genreOverlap\":2},{\"id\":9373,\"title\":\"Blackbeard\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jI1jtvc3fksd9D9nxUj1areYhwP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.1,\"year\":2006,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.2722222222222222,\"_genreOverlap\":2}],\"seasonNumber\":6,\"seasonName\":\"Season 6\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lKVppT3pUcns2fufFXP8fAdGR5J.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2022-11-11\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Fortune Favors the Bold\",\"overview\":\"Dustin Hurt faces a dilemma: risk his life and financial ruin by purchasing and mining one of the most legendary and inhospitable claims in Alaska or play it safe in the white water of McKinley Creek.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/44h310xMljgSSYp5a9ueUfbsvly.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-11\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Into the Unknown\",\"overview\":\"Dustin's new Nugget Creek claim is said to hold life-changing deposits of gold, but Dustin and his crew must survive the most remote and inhospitable corners of Alaska to get it\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/k7xLFdWHWVTMbLrzP0lJhwkdFQZ.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-18\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"Airboat Accident\",\"overview\":\"With vital supplies running dangerously low at their remote Nugget Creek claim, Dustin attempts the impossible. Meanwhile, Kayla tackles the most dangerous diving conditions they've ever seen.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/tGIX8lYosQVOafckljM8gxETd9U.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-11-25\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Dakota Fred Takes Charge\",\"overview\":\"Battling the raging whitewater at Nugget Creek, Dustin and crew must build a safe harbor for their dredge. Meanwhile, legendary miner Fred Hurt returns to help solve the mystery of the pilings gold.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dDZbGTaup2Q23MX46oR0TL1XQ4d.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-02\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Homemade Highway to Hell\",\"overview\":\"A medical emergency threatens to end the season before it begins. Meanwhile, Kayla fights to gain access to her new claim, by building a 400-foot walkway into the sheer cliffs high above Nugget Creek.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/g9nsUn9pQyiT7hXv1dFSh6vcRHp.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-09\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"Fueling the Pressure\",\"overview\":\"Out of fuel and out of options, Dustin risks his life on a resupply mission, navigating the raging Alaskan white water in the driver seat of his unproven airboat. Kayla comes face to face with a collapsing snow bridge in order to reach her claim. One wrong step could send her season crashing down.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/5A5mKm5nsnrCio4QI7iLu1RwypA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-16\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"At War with a Widowmaker\",\"overview\":\"With a widowmaker looming over the dive site, Dustin takes a new dredging approach that lands him in the path of Nugget Creek's roughest waters. Meanwhile, an emergency at Kayla's site threatens to sideline one of the miners.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6MBgAgK2MOlOc0JD63IlkJNCqc1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-23\",\"runtime\":48},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Explosion at Nugget Creek\",\"overview\":\"A storm tears through Nugget Creek, putting dive sites and dredges in severe jeopardy. Mounting pressure causes a potentially season-ending explosion.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wDFbTLlz7AsGw8k4m2p2258AqPd.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2022-12-30\",\"runtime\":48}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2018-01-19\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}